	shape: "hexagon",
	text: [
		"The ICF is an expensive 17x5 constructed machine that can make up to several GHE per second.",
		"",
		"To start constructing it, place the Core Component",
		"- The  ICF containment vessel wall should be welded",
		"- And the ICF casing should be riveted.",
		"",
		"The reactor doesn't work by itself, needing external lasers to complete the reaction.",
		"",
		"§6Reactor§r",
		"",
		"When provided with cooling fluid, the reactor works by focusing the fed fuel pellet using two external laser units, heating up the cooling fluid, generating Stellar Flux, and electricity.",
		"",
		"The top buffers are for fuel pellets and the bottom for depleted.",
		"",
		"Pellets can be made in the ICF Fuel Pellet Maker. Can be automated.",
		"",
		"§6Lasers§r",
		"",
		"See next quest."
